            <Modification_Detail>
                <modification_date>2025-11-25</modification_date>
                <version_id>7.0</version_id>
                <description>
                    Part of MAVEN Release 43 (2025-11-14): This version is 
                    a full re-release of LP-NT data from 2015-01-01 to 
                    2025-02-14, and initial release of 2025-02-15 to 
                    2025-08-14. This reprocessing includes updates to the 
                    LP-product structure. Previously, only the first three 
                    product slots were populated (LP-density, LP-temperature, 
                    LP-potential) and the remaining slots contained no data. 
                    In this version, the first slot now provides 
                    LP-density-combined, and the remaining slots are populated 
                    with additional LP-density and related derived quantities.
                    This release includes incremental coverage for WN data
                    from 2025-02-15 to 2025-08-01.
                </description>
            </Modification_Detail>
